title: Settings › Page › Other controls and notices
route: /settings
intro: Everything on the Settings page that is not an agent row or the pause button: the sidebar item, the always-on notices, the Gates card, tooltips, toasts and the things the page does not have.
dir: TD
also: Found by reading the page and testing it. There is no Save, Apply or Reset button anywhere on the page.
---
start s1 "Click 'Settings' in the sidebar"
screen p1 "Settings\nThe sidebar item turns forest green while the page is open"

group gBan "Notices"
  toast b1 "'Privacy mode is always on'\nNames, dates and IDs are swapped for codes before an agent reads a chart, and mapped back only on your screen.\nNo switch: it cannot be turned off"
  toast b2 "'All agents are paused'\nOnly while all sixteen switches are off"
endgroup

group gGate "Gates card: 'Agents never pass these without a person'"
  process g1 "Sign-off: A licensed clinician signs every request and appeal."
  process g2 "Confirm: The case owner confirms before agents start, before a next step on a denial, and before any write-back."
  process g3 "Answer: A person answers when an agent asks a question."
  process g4 "Acknowledge: A person acknowledges a payer rule change before drafts are updated."
  process g5 "Pause: An operator can pause one agent or all of them."
endgroup

click h1 "Hover a round agent icon"
process h2 "Tooltip shows the agent and its role\nFor example 'Reader: Reads the chart, protects identifiers'"
process h3 "A long role is cut short with an ellipsis on the row"

group gToast "Toasts on this page"
  toast t1 "'{Agent}: {level}'\nWhen a Freedom level is picked"
  toast t2 "'All agents paused'\nWhen 'Pause all' is confirmed"
  toast t3 "'Agents resumed'\nWhen 'Resume all agents' is clicked"
  wait t4 "A toast stays about four seconds\nClick it to dismiss it sooner"
endgroup

group gNone "What the page does not have"
  endx n1 "No Save, Apply or Reset button\nNo way to change the Gates or the privacy notice"
  endx n2 "Choices are lost on leaving or reloading\nEvery agent returns to its starting level and switch"
endgroup

click d1 "Demo menu, then 'Reset demo data'\nTop bar, any page"
process d2 "Goes to the Dashboard with the toast 'Demo data reset'\nSettings had nothing saved to reset"
goto x1 "Continues in: Settings › Agents › Change an agent's freedom"
goto x2 "Continues in: Settings › Pause › Pause all agents"
goto x3 "Continues in: Global shell › Demo menu › Reset demo data"

s1 --> p1
p1 --> b1 & b2
b2 -.-> x2
p1 --> g1 --> g2 --> g3 --> g4 --> g5
g5 -.-> x2
p1 --> h1 --> h2 --> h3
p1 --> t1
t1 --> t2 --> t3 --> t4
t1 -.-> x1
p1 -.-> n1
n1 --> n2
n2 -.-> d1
d1 --> d2 --> x3
